      "No migras chats. Migras conocimiento operativo. Convierte conversaciones, prompts, decisiones y workflows dispersos en un sistema estructurado para trabajar con Claude Code.": "You don't migrate chats. You migrate operational knowledge. Turn scattered conversations, prompts, decisions, and workflows into a structured system for working with Claude Code.",
