      "El Migration System se desbloquea cuando completas el Advanced Operator Playbook. Este nivel asume que ya sabes operar Claude Code con criterio profesional.": "The Migration System unlocks when you complete the Advanced Operator Playbook. This level assumes you already know how to operate Claude Code with professional judgment.",
